            },
            "description": {
              "value": "To resurrect a creature you've slain, a spellcaster must counteract your influence on its death. The DC of this check is equal to your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher.\n\nIn addition, add two 5th-level spells to your Red Mantis assassin spellbook—both spells must be chosen from the following options: death ward, drop dead, false vision, hallucination, illusory scene, mind probe, or sending. You gain a 5th-level spell slot that you can use to prepare a spell from your Red Mantis assassin spellbook."
            }
          }
